+      consumed by the SPA (status files, dashboard payloads, public
+      operator-runtime mirrors) resolve at their canonical relative
+      paths.
+    - ``v2/frontend/dist/`` SPA — index.html catch-all for client-side
+      routes so /market and /admin/war-room return the SPA HTML.
+
+    Both mounts are read-only. No mount changes Redis, no mount
+    enables live trading, no mount exposes raw credentials."""
